  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n\n<div>A provincial park zone is an area within a provincial park used to describe specific geographies, policies and management priorities.<br /></div><div><br />Additional Time Period Information: end range is an estimate only<br /><br /></div> \n\n<br /><div> <strong>Additional Documentation<br /></strong></div><div><ul><li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Provincial%20Park%20Zone%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Provincial Park Zone - Data Description (PDF)</a></li><li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Provincial Park Zone - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Provincial Park Zone - Documentation (Word)</a></li></ul></div> \n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>On going: data is being continually updated<br /></div> \n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Irregular: data is updated in intervals that are uneven in duration<br /></div> \n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Louis Chora, <a href='mailto:louis.chora@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>louis.chora@ontario.ca</a></div></span>\n<div><br /></div>\n\n\n<div>The data referenced here is licensed <a href='https://lio.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/badb097e306b4d3b8becb3dba3ee5807/data' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Electronic Intellectual Property</a> of the Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources and Forestry and is provided for professional, non-commercial use only.</div>\n</div>"
